--- !u!114 &13941
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 3024}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5f7201a12d95ffc409449d95f23cf332, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 0
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_FontData:
    m_Font: {fileID: 10102, guid: 0000000000000000e000000000000000, type: 0}
    m_FontSize: 9
    m_FontStyle: 0
    m_BestFit: 0
    m_MinSize: 1
    m_MaxSize: 40
    m_Alignment: 0
    m_AlignByGeometry: 0
    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "This is Teona Mayers, 1st officer of the Expedition flagship Daedalus,
    calling all survivors! Since I\u2019m likely the highest ranking officer I\u2019ll
    be assuming command until contact is re-established with Mission Command.\n\n\nOk\u2026
    Now that that is out of the way\u2026 let me give you a heads up on this mess
    we\u2019re in.\n\n\nThe Year is 2486 and we are in Hellion, roughly 190 years
    since our departure from Sol. Now you might have guessed this already, but something\u2019s
    not right here, as it\u2019s been 97 years since arrival and the system is falling
    apart.\n\n\nInstead of waking up immediately on arrival as all command personnel,
    I woke up a short while ago, courtesy of the \u201Cemergency wake up protocols\u201D...
    Cryopod system must have malfunctioned as it rejects all access codes and this
    makes waking other people up near impossible, meaning that we are on our own
    for the time being.\n\n\nAlright\u2026 I barely managed to rig this listening
    post to work as a transmitter and it probably won\u2019t last long, since I used
    an asteroid post instead of a normal relay. I just hope it removes some stress
    from Orthos 1 and 2.\n"
